{"4412510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sacred Echoes", "steam_appid": 4412510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4927810], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred Echoes is a story-driven action adventure. Play as The Shattered One and fight alongside your gang of swordsmen and gunslingers across floating islands to confront the man who shattered the Crystal Bound Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/ef956d5e7157078b1264c3b5a05a6167.poster.avif?t=1785358727\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/ef956d5e7157078b1264c3b5a05a6167.webm?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/ef956d5e7157078b1264c3b5a05a6167.mp4?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sacred Echoes cast features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Billie Fulford-Brown - </strong>Award winning narrator,<strong> </strong>Sophie in Clair Obscur: Expedition 33.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oompaville - </strong>YouTuber (6m subscribers).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Keeble - </strong>Monoco in Clair Obscur: Expedition 33, Two Face in Lego Batman: Legacy of the Dark Knight, Fenrico in Wuthering Waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/c5fe971f130b7fd43569911dac041dac.poster.avif?t=1785358727\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/c5fe971f130b7fd43569911dac041dac.webm?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/c5fe971f130b7fd43569911dac041dac.mp4?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clean combat with multiple styles.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your weapon and carve your path by fighting difficult bosses. They range from relentless swordsmen to giant beasts that will crush you. The combat in Sacred Echoes is unique, time hits with the attack bar and land dodges with the dodge bar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/4caeb5e5b2f49d68eecf0b6f5d63e384.poster.avif?t=1785358727\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/4caeb5e5b2f49d68eecf0b6f5d63e384.webm?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/4caeb5e5b2f49d68eecf0b6f5d63e384.mp4?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Use cards and play in different ways.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After 10 seconds in combat you can choose a card to impact the fight. Your main options are healing, dealing more damage, or regenerating consumables. Upgrading in different ways outside of combat effects you damage, health, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/6726e807aa54b932701ee62f6594f402.poster.avif?t=1785358727\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/6726e807aa54b932701ee62f6594f402.webm?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/6726e807aa54b932701ee62f6594f402.mp4?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Deep story &amp; character depth.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacred Echoes is not only about combat, it's about story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As The Shattered One, you will journey across floating islands filled with dangerous bosses, secrets, and unexpected allies who may help you along the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you progress, allies will turn to important members of your group. You will discover more about them through cutscenes, interactions, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you become stronger through weapons and skills, you will eventually face “The Man”. He has slain all who have stood in his way, and his appearance has been long forgotten.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only truth left is if you reach him, there is only one way forward… kill him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/83b68cbab3e28961c628f380ad42f83f.poster.avif?t=1785358727\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/83b68cbab3e28961c628f380ad42f83f.webm?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/83b68cbab3e28961c628f380ad42f83f.mp4?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Expansive world and locations.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shattered Lands consist of a central island where your gang's camp is located, alongside five floating islands that you must traverse to reach “The Man.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each island holds its own mysteries,  unfamiliar faces, and small side content. Side content  may give you insights into the world or reveal new characters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/788a98d9606b1020a878ec364d8e9539.poster.avif?t=1785358727\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/788a98d9606b1020a878ec364d8e9539.webm?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412510/extras/788a98d9606b1020a878ec364d8e9539.mp4?t=1785358727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shattered Lands are unforgiving, only the most skilled warriors will survive.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred Echoes is a story-driven action adventure. Play as The Shattered One and fight alongside your gang of swordsmen and gunslingers across floating islands to confront the man who shattered the Crystal Bound Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a